WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.725
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind create a desktop background.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:11.717
Title: states the topic of a page or slide. Font: changes how writing appears.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:18.275
Colour: helps emphasise important information. Picture: can explain an idea visually.

00:00:18.275 --> 00:00:20.363
Layout: arranges content clearly.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.915
Make a one-page paper example about your school or a Ghanaian festival. Include

00:00:25.915 --> 00:00:29.541
title, font and colour; present it clearly to a partner.
